oid)</strong> the strange townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unravel mysteries</strong> hidden beneath the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Live at your pace</strong> \u2014 no pressure, no deadlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Pixel art world</strong> inspired by Stardew Valley and Twin Peaks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Explore a living world</strong> with dynamic day-night cycles, weather, and changing seasons<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/034177a5da6573a0f90116f793c3801d.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Build your caf\u00e9 from scratch</strong> \u2014 from painting the walls to crafting your first espresso<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/558c58ae780d7ba030b3078539017b05.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Meet the locals</strong> \u2014 each with their own story, personality, and routine<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/6a29cc04f32bf53f74e27f4b3c1bc264.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Plant and tend coffee bushes</strong>, harvest the beans, and roast them yourself<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/e60e0dfbff2757bbd3b1f3528fcffb42.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 